<title>HONG KONG: Silver Eagle financials do not support share price.</title>
<headline>Silver Eagle financials do not support share price.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Silver Eagle Holdings Ltd said on Monday that its past losses and net asset value (NAV) did not support the present price of its shares which have rallied about 138 percent so far this month.</p>
<p>It said in a statement it knew of no reason for the significant rise in its share price.</p>
<p>Trading in Silver Eagle shares resumed on Monday after being suspended last Thursday. The stock fell HK$0.10 to HK$2.475 in early trade.</p>
</text>
